"Local network interfaces: %d" = "本地网络接口：%d";
"Searches received" = "已收到的搜索";
"Unicast queries sent" = "已发送的单播查询";
"Replies relayed" = "已转发的回复";
"Packets discarded" = "已丢弃的数据包";
"The local discovery bridge could not be started." = "无法启动本地发现桥接。";
"The local discovery bridge encountered a network error (%d)." = "本地发现桥接遇到网络错误（%d）。";
"UDP port 30000 or 11452 is already in use. Close the other local discovery bridge or game using these ports, then try again." = "UDP 端口 30000 或 11452 已被占用。请关闭使用这些端口的其他本地发现桥接或游戏，然后重试。";
"No eligible local network interface was found. Connect this Mac to the same network as your devices, then try again." = "未找到符合要求的本地网络接口。请将本 Mac 与设备连接至同一网络，然后重试。";
"Local Network access was denied. Allow NX Port Studio in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Local Network, then try again." = "本地网络访问被拒绝。请在“系统设置”→“隐私与安全性”→“本地网络”中允许 NX Port Studio，然后重试。";
"The local discovery bridge could not allocate its working memory." = "本地发现桥接无法分配工作内存。";
"The local discovery bridge configuration is invalid." = "本地发现桥接配置无效。";
"Language" = "语言";
"Interface language" = "界面语言";
"Homebrew" = "Homebrew";
"Only room discovery is relayed. Gameplay connects the devices directly. LAN lobby joins are verified with an iPhone and a physical Switch in either host role; racing and LDN still need validation." = "桥接仅转发房间发现信息。游戏设备直接互连。已验证 iPhone 和实体 Switch 分别作为房主时均可加入 LAN 房间；比赛和 LDN 仍需验证。";
"Enter a valid registered Nextendo application client ID." = "请输入已注册 Nextendo 应用的有效客户端 ID。";
